  lastly all all students who come from  the biotech domain we know multi-ohmics  data so multiomics contains genomics  transcriptomics proteomics and  metabolomics there are also other omics  data so and this High throughput data of  genomics and mass mass spectrometry  these are also used for  Health informatics cases so nowadays  people are talking about Precision  therapy in cancer in cancer you profile  the particular tissue you profile the  particular  genomic  structure of the tissue you you profile  it using single cell transcriptomics you  find out the main genes which are  perturbed for that for that patient and  you give them a very precise drug as per  that particular Gene profile  next is epidemiological data so  epidemiology actually consists of  population level data so socioeconomic  background education public health  conditions what is the literacy what is  the socioeconomic status how many cars  do I own what is my lifestyle  and these All Things fall under the  category of economical data and actually  from this data we can find out very very  useful insights of multiple diseases so  we can so suppose in the context of  kovit we can find out that which are the  main geographical Pockets from which  kovit is more  concentrated  in the in the context of any lifestyle  disease we can tell that in which  particular population whether it male or  female or males from which particular  part of the country they are more prone  to develop diabetes  and other diseases so this helps us to  detect population level insights so that  we can change the public health policy  accordingly and there also views  informatics  then I already mentioned about time  series data these are mainly data live  streaming data coming from fitbits and  variables like Apple watch or a Samsung  watch like that and from that we can  predict time series analysis and we can  predict a particular event which is  going to come so in the context of  giatric population there is one  important use case called fall  prediction so basically geriatric people  tend to fall very often because of the  lack of proper Mistresses in the blood  pressure so as for the blood pressure  suddenly drops down so if we can predict  from the  past records of blood pressure that this  person is going to have the blood  pressure gradually dropping down and  these and hence an impending fall so we  can  maybe even alert or a notification with  the particular person and the concerned  healthcare workers or the relatives to  tell that this person is going to have a  particular fall and actually fall  incidents do cause a huge burden on the  Healthcare System  in the west as well as in the east  so it's a very important use case fault  for the healthcare organizations  so clinical notes so actually emrs are  not yet  implemented in majority of the countries  we till we still have clinical notes and  these clinical notes are actually they  they are there in sort of silos they are  isolated they are not usable for the  informatics or inside generation so we  have to convert the clinical nodes to a  digital format now this conversion of  clinical nodes to digital format we use  something called OCR now after OCR we  use something called natural language  process called NLP this OCR NLP helps us  to extract clinical note into digital  format and then provide insights and  lastly social network data so you can do  sentiment analysis from Twitter posts  that this person is having this  sentiment as detected by their multiple  posts over the last six months so that  can cause so that tells me that this  person is a high risk for a depression  and maybe a suicide so these suicide  detection and all the mental health  problems this we can do from the  ah these sort of data  so again so this variety of data and  combining all sorts of data  into the by data specific format for a  particular prediction or inside  generation this is what health  informatics consists of and we will be 